@FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5098

### Logowanie - zwraca accessToken i refreshToken
# @name login
POST {{FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "haslo"
}

### Endpoint chroniony uprawnieniem weather.read
GET {{FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Dane zalogowanego użytkownika
GET {{FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Odświeżenie tokenów (stary refresh token przestaje działać)
POST {{FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Wylogowanie bieżącej sesji
POST {{FerrodoERPApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###
